   TITLEONE  oracle 18: blank-keyword continuation lines
   MODELOPT  CONC  FLAT
   AVERTIME  1  24
   POLLUTID  SO2
   RUNORNOT  NOT
   ERRORFIL  18_continuation_lines.err
CO FINISHED

